  "body": "\n<article class=\"page-tools-tool\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/WebPage\">\n<!-- ═══ 2. tool hero ═══ -->\n<section class=\"section-sm\" style=\"padding-top:var(--sp-6);padding-bottom:0;position:relative\">\n<div class=\"wrap\" style=\"max-width:var(--content-w)\">\n<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--sp-4)\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n<ol class=\"breadcrumb-list\">\n<li><a href=\"%BASE%/\" class=\"bc-home-link\"><span class=\"bc-prompt\">&gt;_</span>Home</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"%BASE%/tools/\">Tools</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"breadcrumb-current\" aria-current=\"page\">WordPress Schema / JSON-LD Generator</span></li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://gwillchijioke.qzz.io/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Tools\",\"item\":\"https://gwillchijioke.qzz.io/tools/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"WordPress Schema / JSON-LD Generator\",\"item\":\"https://gwillchijioke.qzz.io/tools/schema-generator/\"}]}</script>\n<div class=\"about-hero\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--sp-6)\">\n<p class=\"label label-green\">&gt;_ tools --schema</p>\n<div class=\"about-intro\">\n<div class=\"about-text\">\n<h1 style=\"font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;margin:16px 0;letter-spacing:-.03em\">WordPress Schema / JSON-LD Generator</h1>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--mid);line-height:1.7;max-width:56ch\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPick a schema type, fill the fields, and get valid JSON-LD for WordPress - with a per-type note on what Gutenberg and the popular SEO plugins already handle vs. what you should add by hand. Everything runs in your browser; nothing is uploaded.\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot ad-slot--leaderboard\">\n<div class=\"ad-slot__spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<s