 value=\"video\">VideoObject</option>\n<option value=\"breadcrumb\">BreadcrumbList</option>\n</select>\n</label>\n<div class=\"sch-fields\" id=\"sch-fields\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sch-side\">\n<div class=\"sch-sec\"><span class=\"sch-sdot\"></span><h2>OUTPUT</h2><span class=\"sch-line\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"sch-outbox\">\n<div class=\"sch-outcap\"><span>generated JSON-LD</span><span class=\"line\"></span><span id=\"sch-byteCount\" style=\"color:var(--dim)\">0 B</span></div>\n<pre class=\"sch-out\"><code id=\"sch-out\"></code></pre>\n<div class=\"sch-note\" id=\"sch-note\"></div>\n<div class=\"sch-btnrow\">\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"sch-btn sch-p\" id=\"sch-copy\">Copy JSON-LD</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"sch-btn\" id=\"sch-dl\">Download .jsonld</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sch-btnrow\">\n<span class=\"sch-privacy\"><span class=\"sch-dot\"></span> generated and validated entirely on your device - nothing is uploaded</span>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- ═══ related tools (6-point law #3) ═══ -->\n<section class=\"sch-related\" aria-labelledby=\"sch-related-h\">\n<h2 id=\"sch-related-h\" class=\"sch-related-h\">&gt;_ Related tools</h2>\n<div class=\"sch-related-grid\">\n<a class=\"sch-rel-card\" href=\"%BASE%/tools/htaccess-generator/\">\n<span class=\"sch-rel-name\">.htaccess Generator</span>\n<span class=\"sch-rel-desc\">Build the site rules the schema lives inside.</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"sch-rel-card\" href=\"%BASE%/tools/json-formatter/\">\n<span class=\"sch-rel-name\">JSON Formatter</span>\n<span class=\"sch-rel-desc\">Validate and minify the generated JSON-LD.</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"sch-rel-card\" href=\"%BASE%/tools/config-explainer/\">\n<span class=\"sch-rel-name\">Config Explainer</span>\n<span class=\"sch-rel-desc\">Read your .htaccess or nginx block back in plain English.</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"sch-rel-card\" href=\"%BASE%/tools/debug-log-analyzer/\">\n<span class=\"sch-rel-name\">Debug Log Analyzer</span>\n<span class=\"sch-rel-desc\">When a schema plugin errors, read the log.</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- ═══ visible FAQ (6-point law #2 - mirrors the FAQPage schema byte-exact) ═══ -->\n<section class=\"sch-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"sch-faq-h\">\n<h2 id=\"sch-faq-h\" class=\"sch-faq-h\">&gt;_ FAQ</h2>\n<details class=\"sch-faq-item\">\n<summary>What is JSON-LD schema on WordPress?</summary>\n<p>A small JSON script you add to the page head so search engines understand your content - an Article, Product, FAQ, Event and so on. This tool generates the markup and tells you how to add it in WordPress.</p>\n</details>\n<details class=\"sch-faq-item\">\n<summary>Does Gutenberg output schema automatically?</summary>\n<p>Not really. Gutenberg has no built-in JSON-LD generator. Most people use an SEO plugin (Rank Math, Yoast, SEO Press) which auto-adds schema for Articles, Products (via WooCommerce) and Breadcrumbs, or a dedicated schema plugin - and hand-add the rest.</p>\n</details>\n<details class=\"sch-faq-item\">\n<summary>Do I still get rich results from FAQ schema?</summary>\n<p>Google restricted FAQ rich results to authoritative government and health sites in 2023, so it is low-value for most blogs now - though the structured data itself is still harvested and can help entity clarity.</p>\n</details>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot ad-slot--in-content\">\n<div class=\"ad-slot__spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"ad-spinner\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" opacity=\".25\"/>\n<path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 0-9-9\"/>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"ad-slot__spinner-text\">Ad loading…</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot__content\">\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"desktop\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwil